"ts":"1617600165.438600","edited":{"user":"U01DYF7UD2L","ts":"1617600189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZGdZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69c5c1a2-b953-4111-8a8a-0730540443e6","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"出てないってことは実際そこを通過してなかったみたいな\nelse も書いて置けば確実にどこ通ったかわかるのでは","ts":"1617600090.437700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YyR/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76706328-d821-475c-b282-597f0a89d0aa","type":"message","user":"U01DYF7UD2L","text":"今やったらechomで出てきました:pensive:","ts":"1617600023.436800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7V4so"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca3e7f10-394f-4753-a011-ad2d602188f9","type":"message","user":"U01DYF7UD2L","text":"条件分岐できました！ありがとうございます。\nでも、neovimでechomでも:messageでもやっぱりログが出てこない...なんでだろう","ts":"1617599939.436200","edited":{"user":"U01DYF7UD2L","ts":"1617599955.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AzauG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f62e82b9-201a-4719-a4d9-d531854b8a9a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"山岡ぁ！","ts":"1617599836.434600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LIZf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00c958f2-99bc-41d1-ad59-1e182e1c82d7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u0026gt; 明日また来てください。本当のメッセージをお見せしますよ。","ts":"1617599811.434300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EWVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f4fa282-29db-470a-8954-b45eb39fbd29","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"このヘルプの「本当のメッセージ」が意味不明だといつも思っている","ts":"1617599736.433500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BYfW3"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *:echom* *:echomsg*\n:echom[sg] {expr1} ..   式を本当のメッセージとして表示し、そのメッセージをメッ\n                        セージ履歴|message-history|に保存する。\n                        |:echo|コマンド同様に、引数の間にスペースが挿入される。\n                        しかし印字不可能な文字は解釈されずに表示される。\n                        |:echo|とはかなり異なり、むしろ|:execute|に近い方法で\n                        解析がされる。なんらかを表示する前に、まず最初に全ての\n                        式が数値または文字列に評価されない場合は、string() を\n                        使用して文字列に変換する。\n                        強調を行うには|:echohl|コマンドを使う。\n                        例:  \n                :echomsg \"It's a Zizzer Zazzer Zuzz, as you can plainly see.\"\n                        画面を再描画したときメッセージが消去されてしまうのを避\n                        ける方法については|:echo-redraw|を参照。\n```","ts":"1617599636.432800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"ce90eb82-ce67-427a-8967-2ed8c59341ff","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":":help :echom","ts":"1617599635.432700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NBgO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d0179f4-9b2a-4980-876a-aa5d78b6d274","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"履歴は `:message` で見れます。","ts":"1617599627.432400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yhtw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aede313-82bf-4e29-b4cc-b9191d75fda3","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"printf デバッグ的に使うなら `:echom` のほうが履歴を見れてよいかも","ts":"1617599605.432000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xkq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b64f524-1339-455c-9009-b442fd8cf6f4","type":"message","user":"U01DYF7UD2L","text":"ありがとうございます。ifの条件式にそのまま書けるんですね！\nちなみにechoで条件分岐の確認にechoを使っているのですが、nvimだとechoで出てこないんですよね...","ts":"1617599535.431000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_o